# .dockerignore — keep build context lean and never bake local state/secrets.
# (Copy to the repo root as `.dockerignore`. Add/trim per stack.)

# Node / frontend
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.vite
**/coverage

# Python
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/*.db

# Env & secrets — runtime config comes from the Robin-Cloud env/secret cards
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local

# Git & editor cruft
.git
.gitignore
**/.DS_Store
**/*.swp
